🤖 Machine Learning Summary

We trained a Random Forest Classifier to predict flu vaccination for 2022.
Results include:

High ROC-AUC score

Good precision and recall balance

Clear feature contribution patterns

This demonstrates ability to preprocess data, build models, and interpret outputs.

