🚀 How to Run

Open Google Colab.

Upload both datasets into the session.

Run the notebook top to bottom.

All dashboards and model outputs are generated automatically.

💡 Future Enhancements

Convert dashboards into a Streamlit or Plotly dashboard

Add clustering for patient segmentation

Build time-series forecasting for encounter trends

Add SHAP explainability for model predictions

